# TrendingRepo 3x/day X autopilot slots (local box time) — dormant until
# trendingrepo-refresh-x-cookies.sh arms TWITTER_OUTBOUND_MODE=live.
# Deployed from repo scripts/ops/trendingrepo-x-autopilot.cron -> /etc/cron.d/trendingrepo-x-autopilot.
# Wrapper logs internally to /var/log/trendingrepo-x-autopilot.log (matches preflight RUN_LOG).
#
# Content-calendar slots (resolveSlotFormat in content-calendar.ts):
#   A 08:47 — criteria-copy trending single, daily
#   B 12:47 — rotating themed pack (Mon agents / Tue rag / Wed mcp / Thu
#             self-hosted / Fri fresh-finds / Sat devtools / Sun weekly-top10)
#   C 17:47 — alternating discovery-single / trending-single
# Each posts one tweet; cap (TRENDING_POST_MAX_PER_DAY=3) + 14d cooldown dedupe.
47 8  * * * root /usr/local/bin/trendingrepo-x-autopilot.sh --slot A
47 12 * * * root /usr/local/bin/trendingrepo-x-autopilot.sh --slot B
47 17 * * * root /usr/local/bin/trendingrepo-x-autopilot.sh --slot C
